    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-24-62">あかりつぎつぎ飛び行けば</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-62-97">赭ら顔黒装束のその若者</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-97-137">こゝろもそらに席に帰れり</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-137-152"><rb>衢</rb><rt>まち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-152-172">覆ふ膠朧光や</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-172-204">夜の穹窿を見入りつゝ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-204-244">若者なみだうちながしたり</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-244-291">大森をすぎてその若者ひそやかに</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-291-334">写真をいだし見まもりにけり</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)"><seg source="#source-334-357">げに一夜</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)"><seg source="#source-357-398">写真をながめ泪ながし</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)"><seg source="#source-398-441">駅々の灯を迎へ送りぬ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-441-482">山山に白雲かゝり夜は明けて</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-482-511">若者やゝに面をあげ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-511-548">田原の坂の地形を説けり</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)"><seg source="#source-548-592">赭ら顔黒装束のその隼人</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 3em" rend="first-line-indent(3)"><seg source="#source-592-631">歯磨などをかけそむる</seg></p>
    </body>
